# Valley Mightcaller (1/1 Trample, {G}): "Whenever another Frog, Rabbit, Raccoon, or Squirrel you control enters, put a +1/+1 counter on
# this creature." Creatures that enter at the same time as it trigger it too (the 2024-07-26 ruling; CR 603.6a, 603.10a: it looks at the
# game as the event happens, when it is already there). Turn 1: Black Lotus pays for the Mightcaller and Poison Dart Frog (a Frog: one
# counter, a 2/2), and Pyroclasm (2 damage to each creature) kills both. Turn 5: Raise the Past returns both (each mana value 2 or
# less) at once, and the new Mightcaller - a new object without the old counter (CR 400.7) - gets a counter for the Frog: a 2/2 with
# one counter, not zero and not two.

